:: Morning Routine Weekday 1 [interaction] {"position":"525,1900","size":"100,100"}
/* A weekday, her corruption stage 1. She's dressed for work and it's done against the clock, kneeling by the bed.
   Included by Morning Routine. */
/* morning_blowjob_weekday_1_0: she comes in dressed for the office, mug and phone, kneels down beside the bed */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_weekday_1_0.mp4" "" "" 600>>

Six-forty, and the knock comes right on schedule, two soft raps and then a third, the way she's knocked on my door ever since I was old enough to lock it. She doesn't wait for an answer anymore. She comes in already dressed for the office, hair pinned up, lipstick on, my mug in one hand and her phone in the other.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Morning, sweetie. You've got the diner people at ten, and $darius.name wants the numbers before that, so don't let him corner you at the coffee machine, he does that thing where he asks one little question and it turns into forty minutes." },
{ text: "She sets the mug on the nightstand with the handle toward me and kneels down beside the bed, tugging her skirt so it won't ride up and checking her stockings for runs. Only then does she fold the blanket back." },
{ who: $mom, text: "And there's a banana in your bag, and don't make that face, I've seen what you call breakfast." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Let her get on with it">>
/* morning_blowjob_weekday_1_1: kneeling beside the bed in her work clothes, her phone on the floor next to her */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_weekday_1_1.mp4" "" "" 600>>

She's careful at first, with her lipstick and her stockings, and most of all with the time. Her phone lies face up on the carpet next to her knee, and every so often her eyes slide over to it. She has this down to the minute, and it would take nothing at all to make her late. I put my hand on the back of her head and slow her down, just to see what she does.

She lets me. Her eyes go to the phone one more time, and after that they don't go there again.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "You're going to be late." },
{ text: "She makes a small, put-upon noise, the one she makes when somebody walks across her clean kitchen floor in their shoes, and keeps going." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Finish">>
/* morning_blowjob_weekday_1_2: the finish */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_weekday_1_2.mp4" "" "" 600>>

Afterwards she sits back on her heels, a little out of breath, and wipes the corner of her mouth with her thumb. She gets up, checks her lipstick in the mirror on my closet door, fixes it with two quick dabs, and picks her purse up off the floor.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Seven minutes. I'm going to say it was the traffic on Fifth, honey, and if anybody asks, you're going to back me up." },
{ who: $player, text: "Nobody's going to ask." },
{ who: $mom, text: "$darius.name will. Well, he won't ask, he'll just look at his watch and not say anything, which is so much worse." },
{ text: "She bends down on her way to the door and kisses my forehead, the same as she did every school morning of my life." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Drink your coffee." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

Then her heels on the stairs, her keys, the front door, and her car backing out of the driveway seven minutes later than it does on any other weekday.

<<include "Morning Routine End">>
<</linkreplace>>
<</linkreplace>>


:: Morning Routine Weekday 2 [interaction] {"position":"525,2025","size":"100,100"}
/* A weekday, her corruption stage 2 (after The Catalyst Night). She's stopped hurrying: she moves a meeting for it, comes
   in with her blouse still open, lies across the bed in her work clothes. Included by Morning Routine. */
