<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_weekday_2_0.mp4" "" "" 600>>

She's early today. It's barely six-thirty when the door opens, and the knock comes after she's already in the room, which is the wrong way around. She's in her work skirt and stockings, but her blouse is only buttoned halfway up, as if she ran out of patience with it.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "I moved the nine o'clock to nine-thirty. Don't look at me like that, it was a very boring nine o'clock, and I thought, well, why should you get the rushed version when you're the one who..." },
{ text: "She doesn't finish that one either. She sets the coffee down, sits on the edge of the bed and runs her hand down my chest and under the blanket, taking her time about it." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

Since that night in her bed she's stopped acting as if this is a favor she's doing me. She just comes in and does it, the way she'd come in to open the curtains.

<<linkreplace "Pull her closer">>
/* morning_blowjob_weekday_2_1: she lies across the bed in her work clothes, lipstick on, no hurry */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_weekday_2_1.mp4" "" "" 600>>

She stretches out across the bed with her shoes still on, skirt and all, and doesn't worry about her lipstick at all. Every now and then she stops to talk, as if we're at the breakfast table.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
