<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_weekday_2_2.mp4" "" "" 600>>

When she sits up there's a ring of her lipstick on me, and she laughs out loud at it, delighted. She licks her thumb and rubs at it the way she used to rub jam off our faces in the car before church.

<<silently>>
